    "CPU percentages are sampled aggregate CPU across threads, not wall-time speedups; cumulative categories overlap.",
    "Allocation counts and bytes are sampled estimates, not exact allocation totals or peak RSS. Go heap profiles may omit the most recent allocations until a later GC; tRPC is especially short and has no sampled checker type-constructor allocations.",
    "Profiles include profiler overhead. PGO training uses the same four benchmark workloads; improvement on these workloads is not evidence of generalization."
  ],
